body:
Easy to use. Simple interface. Can sync with apple reminders app. 

I WISH IT HAD A LIST FEATURE!!! Then you could have a &#34;go to grocery store&#34; reminder and the grocery list in the same as app. 

5th star reserved for when developers enable location triggered reminders. Ex: &#34; Remind me when I get to 123 Main St to ....&#34;
